research question needs to be asked, given the literature that just got rev=
iewed and the authors&rsquo; characterization of that literature. However, =
I think there is room to ask whether these relationships have been rigorous=
ly demonstrated with data that are designed to assess causal relationships.=
 I think it might be the case that past work is observational and cross-sec=
